reviewed('cfm-job-2026','Come, Follow Me 2026 · Job',base+'manual/come-follow-me-for-home-and-church-old-testament-2026/33?lang=eng','The lesson studies faith, helpful friendship, resurrection, and God’s wider view.','The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints',2026,cfm,'Complete main and children’s lesson sections reviewed. Coverage follows named reading blocks and specific discussion passages.','Linked Scripture Helps, talks, videos, and other scriptures were not reviewed. The lesson treats the opening conversation as poetry, not an actual bargain.','Come, Follow Me','lds')
reviewed('lds-job-111','Lesson 111: Job 1–16 · Seminary student material',base+'manual/old-testament-seminary-student-material-2018/job/lesson-111?lang=eng','The lesson contrasts Job’s suffering with his friends’ false accusations.','The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints',2018,list(range(1,17)),'Complete main lesson and quiz text reviewed. Linked media were not reviewed.','Some chapters receive only a general summary. The lesson affirms a historical Job through religious sources. This is Church teaching, not independent historical verification.','LDS study manual','lds')
reviewed('lds-job-112','Lesson 112: Job 17–42 · Seminary student material',base+'manual/old-testament-seminary-student-material-2018/job/lesson-112?lang=eng','The lesson connects Job’s hope with resurrection and God’s plan.','The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints',2018,list(range(17,43)),'Complete main lesson, embedded teaching excerpts, and quiz text reviewed.','Chapters 20–37 receive a brief general overview. Linked talks and videos were not reviewed. Later teaching remains distinct from the passage’s wording.','LDS study manual','lds')
